A.1 Gathering Resources 
Player walks in the open world collecting resources. The player have to interact with the resources (for example, click button collect), so they can pick the resources. Otherwise, they will passing by the resources. The gathered resources added to inventory. 

A.2 Crafting Items
Open Crafting Window will allows player to use collected material in the inventory to craft new item. Each item will require different combinations of materials or how many each material needed. If the resources is available, player can click craft button to craft the desired item. 

A.3 Build Buildings
Player can craft hammer to build a building. In the build button, player can choose which blueprint they want to use. The player will place the blueprint in the open world. If the resources in the inventory sufficient, the blueprint will be replaced by the finished building. If the resources is insufficient, the blueprint will remain in the open world with displaying how much resources collected and how much that still needed. The player also have "move" option aside from build. They can move either blueprint or finished building in the open world. 

